  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/centraal_hal.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Centraal Station \u00b7 Hal (the city, district 7: Centraal): the front hall of Centraal behind the middle arch: brick and sandstone, a dark timber ceiling, lanterns; the shops along the walls shuttered, the boards still lit with trains that won't run, the gate line shut on red but for the gap the army cut in it, and beyond it the escalators down to line 52. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
